# GeoDaily is a fully static site (GitHub Pages). It needs no runtime secrets.
#
# GEMINI_API_KEY is used ONLY by the challenge-generation script
# (scripts/generate-challenges.ts), which runs in the
# "Generate daily challenges" GitHub Action. Configure it as a repository
# secret named GEMINI_API_KEY — it is never bundled into the client.
#
# For local generation you can set it here:
GEMINI_API_KEY=""

# VITE_BASE: base path for the build. Defaults to /geodaily/ (GitHub Pages
# project site). Set to "/" for a custom domain or user/org page, or for local
# testing at the root.
# VITE_BASE="/"
